### 1. Create Policy
POST http://localhost:8080/api/policies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "POL-1001",
  "customerName": "Rahul Sharma",
  "policyType": "MOTOR",
  "insuredValue": 1200000,
  "premium": 32000,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}


### 2. Create Claim
POST http://localhost:8080/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "claimNumber": "CLM-5001",
  "policyNumber": "POL-1001",
  "customerName": "Rahul Sharma",
  "incidentType": "ACCIDENT",
  "claimAmount": 850000,
  "status": "SUBMITTED"
}


### 3. Evaluate Claim Risk
GET http://localhost:8080/api/claims/1/risk

### 4. Create Billing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/billing
Content-Type: application/json
{
  "billingId": "BILL-1001",
  "policyNumber": "POL-1001",
  "amountPaid": 10000
}

### 5. Get All Billing
GET http://localhost:8080/api/billing